reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-103540" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2x & 3 & 2 \\\\ x & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2x & 2 \\\\ x & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2x & 3 \\\\ x & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(-3-2)i-(-2x-2x)j+(2x-3x)k \\\\  & =⟨-5,-4x,x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{(-5)^{2}+(-4x)^{2}+{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25+16{x}^{2}+{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{17{x}^{2}+25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{93} \\\\ \\sqrt{17{x}^{2}+25} & =\\sqrt{93} \\\\ 17{x}^{2}+25 & =93 \\\\ 17{x}^{2} & =68 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=\\pm 2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "bf2af88b78c0f972594e3b8650f252763c7c3809d8ad4c0c602d226452cc8e27" "basis" 1376 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-103540" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0118fa4be877af9d984d96913b8c4eb3649797d2aa3621bd31fccb9b4080a716" "basis" 1376 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-103540" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home