egin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2\\cdot (-1)-(-1)\\cdot 2)i-(4\\cdot (-1)-(-1)\\cdot 2)j+(4\\cdot 2-2\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =(-2+2)i-(-4+2)j+(8-4)k \\\\  & =2j+4k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1396" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2b0550090cc26f93266a7b0f166dd854d1a1cbe6f6ecc0508c6c1b68bfd5def3"} {"question" "q-1396" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1396" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2j+3k"] ["math" "2j+4k"] ["math" "3i+2j-4k"] ["math" "i-2j+4k"] ["math" "i-3j+6k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1396" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2j+4k"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $u=7i+3j-4k$ and $v=-i-4j+3k.$ Find $u\\times v.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 7 & 3 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}7 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3\\cdot 3-(-4)\\cdot (-4))i-(7\\cdot 3-(-4)\\cdot (-1))j+(7\\cdot (-4)-(3)\\cdot (-1))k \\\\  & =(9-16)i-(21-4)j+(-28+3)k \\\\  & =-7i-17j-25k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2b0550090cc26f93266a7b0f166dd854d1a1cbe6f6ecc0508c6c1b68bfd5def3"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-7i+17j+31k"] ["math" "-7i-17j+25k"] ["math" "-7i-17j-25k"] ["math" "25i+25j-25k"] ["math" "25i-17j-25k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-1404" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-7i-17j-25k"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=3i-4j+k$ and $b=-2i+5j+6k.$ Find $a\\times b.$\n\n$a\\times b=$\n\n{{field-1}}$\\,i\\,-\\,$\n{{field-2}}$\\,j\\,+\\,$\n{{field-3}}$\\,k$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-4)(6)-(1)(5))i-((3)(6)-(1)(-2))j+((3)(5)-(-4)(-2))k \\\\  & =(-24-5)i-(18+2)j+(15-8)k \\\\  & =-29\\,i-20\\,j+7\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "d10a27fa6c765bdbd17de87aa5782ab7f7ad7c81a6a74734775fb7382088e395"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category